[22.258059, "o", "R1_ARM=L R1_ENTRY=implementor R1_ROUTES=coordinator=local,implementor=local,verifier=local,plan=local,implement=local,critique=local,smol=local M2_LOCAL_REPLAY=true\r\n"]
[69.089056, "o", "    p.product_id,\r\n    SUM(o.quantity * o.unit_price) AS sales\r\n  FROM orders o\r\n  JOIN products p ON o.product_id = p.product_id\r\n  WHERE o.order_date >= DATE '2024-10-01'\r\n    AND o.order_date < DATE '2025-01-01'\r\n  GROUP BY p.category, p.product_id\r\n),\r\nranked AS (\r\n  SELECT\r\n    category,\r\n    product_id,\r\n    sales,\r\n    ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY category ORDER BY sales DESC) AS rn\r\n  FROM sales_per_product\r\n)\r\nSELECT category, product_id\r\nFROM ranked\r\nWHERE rn <= 3;\r\n```\r\n\r\nVerification:\r\n\r\n```python\r\ntop3 = con.execute(complex_query).df().groupby('category')['product_id'].apply(list).to_dict()\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n```\r\n{'Clothing': [67, 78, 44],\r\n 'Electronics': [21, 94, 81],\r\n 'Grocery': [85, 84, 22],\r\n 'Home': [3, 64, 88],\r\n 'Toys': [96, 28, 15]}\r\n```\r\n\r\n15 rows – 3 products per category for Q4 2024, sales = `SUM(quantity * unit_price)`.\r\n\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=glimmer-30b tools=14 surface=5ab9d76f1115\r\n"]
